abstract: >-
  Code and compact data for reproducing selected quantitative results of the
  accompanying study. The release contains notebooks for Figures 1-4 and a
  critical-state Tempotron training example. Figure 3 uses the finalized
  20-network, six-signal analysis, including quantitative panels B-E.
keywords:
  - neural criticality
  - coupled neural circuits
  - neuronal avalanches
  - signal representation
  - Tempotron
